 "info": {
  "description": "Bounded simulator subset of the official AWS IoT TwinMaker API (2021-11-29). Every other official operation returns HTTP 501 UnknownOperationException. Workspaces and scenes are configuration metadata: no entity, component type, property value, query, sync job or metadata transfer job exists, and workspace buckets, IAM roles and scene files in Amazon S3 are neither read nor checked. CreateEntity, CreateComponentType, ExecuteQuery and the other data APIs return UnknownOperationException with HTTP 501. Workspaces with scenes cannot be deleted; delete the scenes first. Scenes report no generated scene metadata, the pricing plan is not modeled and ListTagsForResource paging members are refused. SDK clients must disable host-prefix injection (botocore inject_host_prefix=False) because the official api. host prefix cannot address the loopback endpoint.",
  "title": "AWS IoT TwinMaker (simulator catalog)",
  "version": "2021-11-29"
 },
